      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes total sense. it's like you're saying gentle parenting is basically just a recipe for raising spoiled kids. if i were to say in my video that gentle parenting is objectively failing a whole generation of kids because of these issues, would that be a fair assessment based on what we just talked about?",
